~ start
[speed=0.7][shake rate=5 level=2]I got swept away by the water.[/shake][/speed]

[speed=0.6][shake rate=8 level=4]I tried to swim but the water kept pulling me farther and farther away.[/shake][/speed]

[speed=0.7][shake rate=5 level=2]Then... someone found me. They said I was safe now.[/shake][/speed]

[speed=0.6][shake rate=5 level=2]But where's Nanay?[/shake][/speed]

[speed=0.6][shake rate=5 level=2]Where's Tatay?[/shake][/speed]

[speed=0.6][shake rate=6 level=3]Where's Kuya Dodong, Noni, Ate Valerie and Kiki?[/shake][/speed]

[speed=0.7][shake rate=4 level=2]...[/shake][/speed]

[speed=0.6][shake rate=5 level=2]They told me to wait.[/shake][/speed]

[speed=0.6][shake rate=4 level=2]Waiting and waiting…[/shake][/speed]

[speed=0.6][shake rate=6 level=3]I've been waiting for a long time.[/shake][/speed]

[speed=0.7][shake rate=5 level=2]They said they were looking for my family.[/shake][/speed]

[speed=0.6][shake rate=6 level=3]I kept looking at every face that passed by. Maybe Nanay was carrying Kiki. Maybe Ate was holding Noni's hand. Maybe Tatay and Dodong were looking for me too.[/shake][/speed]

[speed=0.5][shake rate=7 level=3]But nobody came…[/shake][/speed]

[speed=0.6][shake rate=8 level=4]How come they haven't found them yet?[/shake][/speed]

[speed=0.6][shake rate=6 level=3]I thought Tatay would always know what to do.[/shake][/speed]

[speed=0.6][shake rate=6 level=3]I thought Nanay would always be there when I woke up.[/shake][/speed]

[speed=0.7][shake rate=4 level=2]…[/shake][/speed]

[speed=0.5][shake rate=7 level=3]I don't understand.[/shake][/speed]

[speed=0.7][shake rate=4 level=2]…[/shake][/speed]

[speed=0.6][shake rate=6 level=3]It was my birthday.[/shake][/speed]

[speed=0.6][shake rate=7 level=3]I'm eight now…[/shake][/speed]

OLLIE: [speed=0.6][shake rate=8 level=4][b]Nay…[/b][/shake][/speed]

OLLIE: [speed=0.6][shake rate=8 level=4][b]Tay…[/b][/shake][/speed]

OLLIE: [speed=0.5][shake rate=10 level=5][b]Please come get me.[/b][/shake][/speed]

[speed=0.5][shake rate=10 level=6]I want to go home.[/shake][/speed]

[speed=0.4][shake rate=20 level=8]But where's my home now?[/shake][/speed]

=> END